| Month lengths | refused: `2027-02-29`, `2027-04-31`, `2027-06-31`; accepted: only `9999-12-31` and `2028-02-29` (older rows) | the last day ACCEPTED for each of the 12 months (a month entry one too small is invisible today for 11 months) and the day after REFUSED for the 9 months not yet covered (a month entry one too large is invisible today for 9 months) |
| Century leap rule | refused `1900-02-29`; accepted `2000-02-29`, `2024-02-29`, `2028-02-29` | `1800-02-29` and `2200-02-29` REFUSED (a `% 200` rule passes today); `1600-02-29` and `2400-02-29` ACCEPTED (a rule that knows only the year 2000 passes today) |
